file crates/io-store/src/lib.rs
symbol write
lines 0 18
hash 284c0f1a28d1b9b8
note Every file the tool writes, the map and the cache alike, goes through here: the bytes land in a temporary file beside the target and are renamed over it, so a reader, or the second of two threads saving at once, never sees a half-written file. A transient error is retried up to six times, 40 ms apart: Windows errors 1224, 32 and 5, which an editor or a scanner holding the file open causes for a moment.

